# Lustra — design system

Tokens live in CSS variables (eventually `packages/ui/tokens.css`). Use **only** scale values — no one-off `13px` / `border-radius: 10px`.

## Palette (semantic)

`--color-bg #FAF7F4` · `--color-surface` · `--color-surface-2 #F1E8E1` · `--color-border #E4D8CF`  
`--color-text #221A17` · `--color-text-2` · `--color-text-3`  
`--color-accent #C25E52` · `--color-accent-700` · `--color-gold #C6A15B` · sage/clay/status as in TECH-DESIGN §23

## Typography

- Display: **Playfair Display** (headings, prices)
- UI: **Manrope** (body, forms) — not Inter/Roboto/Arial as primary brand face
- Spacing/radius/shadows: numeric scales (`--spacing-12`, `--radius-8`, `--shadow-1`)

## Visual rules

- Warm nude paper atmosphere — gradients/grain OK; **no** purple-indigo SaaS gradients, neon glow, glassmorphism stacks.
- Landing/public: brand-first hero; one composition; full-bleed hero plane; no card clutter in first viewport.
- Cards only when they wrap a real interaction; otherwise drop border/shadow/radius.
- Motion: 2–3 intentional motions; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`; animate transform/opacity only.

## Components

Compose from small primitives (`Button`, `SlotChip`, …). New UI must reuse tokens — no hardcoded hex in feature CSS unless introducing a token.
